<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023), Miao et al. (2023) & Adhyapok et al. (2021) epithelial somite rosette vertex mechanics and mesenchymal-to-epithelial transition (MET) model (Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes))",
        "Yamanaka et al. (2023), Miao et al. (2023) & Adhyapok et al. (2021) epithelial somite rosette vertex mechanics and mesenchymal-to-epithelial transition (MET) model faithfully reproduces Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 59.4/100, audit 2026-10-19-somitoid-chirality-buckling-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py> ;
    schema:about "Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py; output: docs/media/somitoid_chirality_buckling_comparison.png; organism: Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 8c03959ff890ec1b1f8ad439282943a83edc0f23b1f485588520aaff56f64a77; artifact_sha256: 3898ad08f10b349f848187fc24c6910f50fc9533db3f460ed71b2253ada778b3; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/scout_manifest.json=8326704c93aa8a75..., datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/somitoid_chirality_buckling_reference.json=9d2c399f6ba95b2e..., datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/somitoid_rosette_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-model-fidelity>,
