<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023), Miao et al. (2023) & Adhyapok et al. (2021) epithelial somite rosette vertex mechanics and mesenchymal-to-epithelial transition (MET) model — MorphoEval overall 59.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py` (60.1/100). The initial baseline evaluates the 1D radial interfacial energy curve E(R_in, N) for a single wild-type somite rosette, but requires a 2D apico-basal vertex polygon relaxation solver across all 6 experimental regimes (WT +Matrigel, Calpeptin hyper-constriction, low Matrigel, EphA4/ephrinB2 knockdown, Y-27632 ROCK inhibition, and Minus-Matrigel unpolarized control), explicit EphA4/ephrinB2 inter-somitic cleft separation dynamics, a 2D phase diagram over (gamma_ap/gamma_lat, Matrigel ECM concentration), and automated bilateral somite rosette and lumen/cortex segmentation on `somitoid_rosette_specimen.jpg`. Overall 59.4/100 (faithfulness 57.4, reproducibility 64.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 54, Parameter expressivity 59, Morphometric validation 56, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 64. Output judged: docs/media/somitoid_chirality_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 496000 B, 1430×624 px, artifact_sha256 3898ad08f10b349f848187fc24c6910f50fc9533db3f460ed71b2253ada778b3 (sha256 3898ad08f10b349f848187fc24c6910f50fc9533db3f460ed71b2253ada778b3), spec_fingerprint 8c03959ff890ec1b1f8ad439282943a83edc0f23b1f485588520aaff56f64a77. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c03959ff890ec1b1f8ad439282943a83edc0f23b1f485588520aaff56f64a77; artifact_sha256: 3898ad08f10b349f848187fc24c6910f50fc9533db3f460ed71b2253ada778b3; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/scout_manifest.json=8326704c93aa8a75..., datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/somitoid_chirality_buckling_reference.json=9d2c399f6ba95b2e..., datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/somitoid_rosette_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement a 2D apico-basal differential interfacial tension vertex solver for an N-cell somite rosette with elastic area constraint K_A(A_i - A_0)^2/2 and evaluate all 6 experimental regimes (WT +Matrigel, Calpeptin hyper-constriction, low Matrigel, EphA4/ephrinB2 KD, Y-27632 ROCK inhibition, Minus-Matrigel control).",
        "remediation needed: Implement bilateral somite rosette peak/cleft segmentation and radial cortex-to-somitecoel intensity profiling on `datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/somitoid_rosette_specimen.jpg`.",
        "remediation needed: Model EphA4/ephrinB2 heterotypic boundary repulsion and inter-somitic cleft separation between adjacent anterior/posterior somite rosettes, plus a 2D phase diagram over (gamma_ap/gamma_lat, Matrigel %)." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.94e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

